flowchart LR
  CB["CHECK-BUILDER<br/>sub-agent, a different model<br/>sees only the task and the library<br/>never sees the design<br/>programs the checks once"]
  DS["DESIGNER<br/>the main agent, Pi loop<br/>builds, reviews, fixes"]
  subgraph ENG["ENGINE WE PROVIDE (serve container, deterministic, tested)"]
    LB["Check library<br/>all-pairs overlap, clearance, ranges,<br/>connectivity, coverage, counts, length<br/>plus custom checks"]
    EV["Evaluation<br/>strict defaults, nothing excluded unless declared<br/>what was examined, injected-fault self-test, objective"]
  end
  TC["TASK CONTAINER<br/>solution.py exposes its items"]
  CB <-->|"reads the library, returns the checks"| LB
  DS <-->|"tags items, asks to evaluate"| EV
  EV <-->|"report: what fails, by how much, what is not checked"| DS
  LB --> EV
  EV <-->|"runs solution, reads the items"| TC
  DS <-->|"read, write, edit, bash"| TC
